---
source: crates/wisp-protocol/src/settings/tests.rs
expression: "rows.join(\"\\n\")"
---
agent
  docs: an agent type's name
  rule: needs a name of 1 to 32 of a-z, 0-9, _ and -, starting with a letter or digit
agents.max_agents
  docs: 1 to 50, or `none`
  rule: must be a whole number from 1 to 50, or none
agents.max_depth
  docs: 1 to 5, or `none`
  rule: must be a whole number from 1 to 5, or none
agents.max_running
  docs: 1 to 16, or `none`
  rule: must be a whole number from 1 to 16, or none
