  docs: 1 to 50, or `none`
  rule: must be a whole number from 1 to 50, or none
agents.wake_when_stuck
  docs: 0 to 1440
  rule: must be a whole number from 0 to 1440
agents.warm_refreshes
  docs: 0 to 24
  rule: must be a whole number from 0 to 24
aliases
  docs: a list of model IDs
  rule: needs a list of model IDs
auth
  docs: one of `api_key`, `bearer`, `anthropic_subscription`, `chatgpt_subscription`, `antigravity_subscription`
  rule: must be one of api_key, bearer, anthropic_subscription, chatgpt_subscription, antigravity_subscription
cache_ttl
  docs: `5m` or `1h`
  rule: must be 5m or 1h
claude_usage
  docs: `true` or `false` in `config.toml`, `on` or `off` on the command line
  rule: must be on or off
compact_at
  docs: tokens (`400k`) or a share of the window (`85%`)
  rule: needs a token count (400000 or 400k) or a share of the window (85%)
context.auto_compact
  docs: `true` or `false` in `config.toml`, `on` or `off` on the command line
  rule: must be on or off
context.background_compaction
  docs: `true` or `false` in `config.toml`, `on` or `off` on the command line
  rule: must be on or off
context.background_tokens
  docs: tokens (`40000`, `40k`, `1M`)
  rule: needs a token count, such as 8000 or 8k
context.compact_effort
  docs: one of `low`, `medium`, `high`, `xhigh`, `max`
  rule: must be one of low, medium, high, xhigh, max
context.context_note
  docs: `true` or `false` in `config.toml`, `on` or `off` on the command line
  rule: must be on or off
context.count_tokens
  docs: `true` or `false` in `config.toml`, `on` or `off` on the command line
  rule: must be on or off
context.strategy
  docs: `default` or a plugin's id
